{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">《流行都市》的「睇餸食飯」環節中，李安生親自示範了一道香辣誘人的「麻辣雜錦海鮮拼盤」。巧妙利用海鮮袋將濃郁醬汁與新鮮海產均勻混合，擺盤極具視覺效果，非常適合聚會時與親友分享，大家快來試做吧！</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>食材與調味料準備</strong></p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li><li></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>製作步驟</strong></p><ol class=\"tiptap-ordered-list\"><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li></ol><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"47ff42c3-4a5b-4591-9188-d0eab084b45d.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026ojmC1hmbrD1790910463.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"47ff42c3-4a5b-4591-9188-d0eab084b45d.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-03T09:18:56.353631+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":109,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}